            "richtext_ELA9jX": {
              "type": "richtext",
              "name": "Richtext",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "richtext": "<p>It wasn't laziness. It was anxiety. (We know now.)</p><p>Awkward AF wasn't born in a boardroom. It was born from that very specific moment where you look back at your younger self and think: I wasn't lazy. I wasn't difficult. I was just really, really struggling.</p>"
