              "type": "heading",
              "name": "Heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "The bit where it started to make sense",
                "heading_type": "h2",
                "heading_size": "heading-h2"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "richtext_kyB9GB": {
              "type": "richtext",
              "name": "Richtext",
              "settings": {
                "richtext": "<p>After finally getting some help (the kind that actually made a difference), the clouds started shifting. Confidence crept in. Anxiety crept out. Mostly.</p><p>With a bit of distance from the chaos, we started to see what it actually was. Anxiety. Awkwardness. The overthinking. Once you can name it, you can own it. And once you own it, it loses its power.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
